@title Cabinet inspector: the plate card closes with its title-bar button (1920x1080)
@area Cabinet
@sizes 1920x1080
# Plate setup opens the inspector with the plate card; its title bar now has a close button, so it can be dismissed without clicking an empty spot. (Tadjiro laptop test, finding 27.)
open qa/fixtures/emc-cabinet-bonding.novo
wait 20
key ctrl+k
wait 6
text plate setup
wait 8
key Enter
wait 30
expect "Mounting plate (mm)"
shot 01-plate-card-with-close
check_layout
# The close button sits at the right of the title bar.
click 1885 194
wait 15
expect_not "Mounting plate (mm)"
shot 02-closed
check_layout
